{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4B43YN7Z75VEEY1YRT89R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"授業中の私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと大学生してるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これが本当の私かなって感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4B55Y8V84XYYHXXD6XB5R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ中間の時期でまた課題とテストに追われる〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4B65Q3STN04SPT6KH0236","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと聞いてます。今期、割と必死です。というか今年。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH4B74HMEADWMBP0B0HW8WS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちら、アイドルの私です。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルに見えます、、か？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも毎日必死です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも握手会に来てくれるみなさんと同じ学校だったら\nきっと意気投合して仲良しになってたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と握手をしに来てくれるみなさんに感謝しかないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと会えるのは友達に会うくらい楽しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって友達は宝物でいなくなったら生きて行けないくらい大切な存在で\n私を支えてくれる存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもそんな宝物の友達と同じくらい大切な私を支えてくれる存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつも本当に私に元気をくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会はアイドルモードの私で行こうと思います。\n個別握手会はアイドルモードの私か大学生モードの私を選択できることにしようかな？\nもし希望があれば、対応を大学生モードの私にします。\nってどんなモードかな？\nちょっと色々考えてみます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週も今日の15時から明日の14時まで\n個別握手会の受付してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここから受付してるので\n握手しに来てくれたらうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://fortunemusic.jp/keyakizaka46_201704/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお"}],"source":"archive"}